  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/aa4b32c5c2a037a20e4d4661359c3196b0f71063271e5df111ac933b7666f423.png] \n\nGiven Equation: 306 * 17 * 38 * 2 * 41 = 53\n\n**Option 1: **÷, +, ×, −\n\n306 ÷ 17 + 38 × 2 - 41 = 53\n\n⇒ 18 + 38 × 2 - 41 = 53\n\n⇒ 18 + 76 - 41 = 53\n\n⇒ 94 - 41 = 53\n\n⇒ 53 = 53\n\nOption 2: ÷, +, −, ×\n\n306 ÷ 17 + 38 - 2 × 41 = 53\n\n⇒ 18 + 38 - 82 = 53\n\n⇒ 56 - 82 = 53\n\n⇒ 26 ≠ 53\n\nOption 3: +, ÷, −,×\n\n306 + 17 ÷ 38 - 2 × 41 = 53\n\n⇒ 306 + 0.447 - 82 = 53\n\n⇒ 306.447 - 82 = 53\n\n⇒ 224.447 ≠ 53\n\nOption 3: +, ÷, ×, −\n\n306 + 17 ÷ 38 × 2 - 41 = 53\n\n⇒ 306 + 0.447 × 2 - 41 = 53\n\n⇒ 306 + 0.894 - 41 = 53\n\n⇒ 306.894 - 41 = 53\n\n⇒ 265.894 ≠ 53\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**÷, +, ×, −**\".",
